<title>AUSTRALIA: Cityview to list on NASDAQ smallcap market.</title>
<headline>Cityview to list on NASDAQ smallcap market.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian oil explorer Cityview Energy Corp Ltd said on Wednesday that approval has been given by NASDAQ in the United States for CityView to trade its shares on the NASDAQ SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>Trading of Cityview's shares on NASDAQ is scheduled to start on June 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Cityview is about 46 percent owned by Malaysia Mining Corp Bhd. The Australian group has a market capitalisation of about A$78 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
